# fixtures/lq/cases/std.cases: the standard library of [LQ/std] (WP-22, R-FIX).
# Part 1: the 45 lq-define blocks, copied byte-exact into fixtures/lq/std/<name>.lq ([LQ/std §2.6]); each parses
